  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n17 : 253\n\n__17 × 9__ + 100 = 253\n\n__**153 + 100**__ = 253 \n\n253 = 253 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n19 : 271\n\n__19 × 9__ + 100 = 271\n\n__171 + 100__ = 271\n\n271 = 271 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) 21 : 289\n\n__21 × 9__ + 100 = 289\n\n__189 + 100__ = 289\n\n**289 = 289 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) 23 : 207\n\n__23 × 9__ + 100 = 207\n\n__207 + 100__ = 207 \n\n307 ≠ 207 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 31 : 400\n\n__31 × 9__ + 100 = 400\n\n__279 + 100__ = 400\n\n379 ≠ 400 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 32 : 387\n\n__32 × 9__ + 100 = 387\n\n__288 + 100__ = 387\n\n388 ≠ 387 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options, '21 : 289' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
